1
00:00:00,126 --> 00:00:01,656
(gasps)
There's Amy.

2
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:03,330
(Sheldon:)I just know
you're gonna hit it off.

3
00:00:03,329 --> 00:00:06,059
(Sheldon:)You both have
the same fashion sense.

4
00:00:07,032 --> 00:00:10,732
Hello! Come in,
say hi to my Meemaw.

5
00:00:10,736 --> 00:00:12,206
(Amy:)Hi. Nice to meet you.

6
00:00:12,204 --> 00:00:13,734
(Meemaw:)Nice to meet you, too.

7
00:00:13,739 --> 00:00:14,739
(Amy:)How was your trip?

8
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:15,810
(Meemaw:)Wonderful.

9
00:00:15,808 --> 00:00:17,538
(Meemaw:)And the pilot did
such a good job,

10
00:00:17,543 --> 00:00:19,243
(Meemaw:)I gave him a butterscotch.

11
00:00:19,245 --> 00:00:21,215
(laughs)
That's great.

12
00:00:21,213 --> 00:00:23,643
(Amy:)And look at you,
sitting in Sheldon's spot.

13
00:00:23,649 --> 00:00:25,249
(Amy:)You know, I don't
even get to sit there.

14
00:00:25,251 --> 00:00:26,481
(Penny:)Yeah.

15
00:00:26,485 --> 00:00:28,185
(Sheldon:)And you never will.

16
00:00:28,187 --> 00:00:31,017
(Sheldon:)Ooh, hey, oh, ask her to do the
tissue thing.

17
00:00:31,023 --> 00:00:32,193
(Sheldon:)Do it, ask her.

18
00:00:33,392 --> 00:00:34,522
(Amy:)Can I have a tissue?

19
00:00:34,527 --> 00:00:35,927
(Meemaw:)Of course.

20
00:00:35,928 --> 00:00:38,728
(laughs)

21
00:00:38,731 --> 00:00:39,931
Isn't that the best?!

22
00:00:39,932 --> 00:00:42,102
(Sheldon:)She's like Grandma Spider-Man.

23
00:00:43,102 --> 00:00:44,802
(Meemaw:)He's been saying that

24
00:00:44,804 --> 00:00:46,104
(Meemaw:)since he was little.

25
00:00:46,105 --> 00:00:48,605
(Meemaw:)I still don't know
what it means.

26
00:00:48,607 --> 00:00:50,807
(Sheldon:)Oh, well, you two sit down
and get to know each other.

27
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:52,080
(Sheldon:)I'll get your room ready.

28
00:00:52,077 --> 00:00:53,547
(Meemaw:)Oh, now don't you go
looking through

29
00:00:53,546 --> 00:00:55,376
(Meemaw:)my suitcase for presents.

30
00:00:55,381 --> 00:00:56,851
(Sheldon:)If I did, would I find any?

31
00:00:56,849 --> 00:00:58,079
(Meemaw:)Maybe.

32
00:00:58,083 --> 00:01:02,023
(Meemaw:)But you also might find
my brassieres and bloomers.

